      &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &MIXING
        METHOD PULAY_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.4
        NPULAY 8
      &END MIXING
      &PRINT
        &RESTART OFF
        &END RESTART
      &END PRINT
    &END SCF
    &XC
